    },
    "BBBuddy 会在设备上保存宝宝资料、照护记录、成长数据和你选择的照片。应用不出售个人数据，也不使用第三方广告或跨应用追踪。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BBBuddy stores baby profiles, care records, growth data, and selected photos on your device. The app does not sell personal data or use third-party advertising or cross-app tracking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BBBuddy 會在裝置上儲存寶寶資料、照護記錄、成長資料和你選擇的照片。App 不會出售個人資料，也不使用第三方廣告或跨 App 追蹤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BBBuddy 会把当天的照护整理成看得懂的节奏，也把成长中的第一次留在正确的月龄。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BBBuddy turns daily care into a rhythm you can understand, while keeping each first at the right age."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BBBuddy 會把當天照護整理成容易理解的節奏，也把成長中的第一次留在正確月齡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BBBuddy 会按记录 ID 合并；本机已有记录不会被覆盖。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
