    "圆滚滚、慢吞吞，是让紧张日常慢慢软下来的黑白小团子。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Round and unhurried, with a black-and-white calm that softens a busy day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "圓滾滾、慢吞吞，會讓緊張的日常慢慢柔和下來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圆滚滚、步伐慢半拍，擅长把普通日常变得可爱。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
