    "相机、照片、麦克风和运动权限仅在对应功能需要时请求，可随时在系统设置中关闭。你可以在应用中删除记录和照片；停止家庭共享后，其他成员将无法继续访问后续同步内容。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Camera, photo, microphone, and motion access is requested only when a related feature needs it and can be disabled in Settings. You can delete records and photos in the app. After Family Sharing ends, other members can no longer access future synced content."
